WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.987
Follow blood through the
valves, using the original OpenStax

00:00:03.020 --> 00:00:04.976
heart as an anatomical reference.

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:09.550
During passive ventricular filling,
the atrioventricular valves are open

00:00:09.580 --> 00:00:11.367
and the semilunar valves are closed.

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:13.971
Atrial systole completes filling.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.311
The ventricles begin isovolumetric systole.

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:22.023
Atrioventricular valves close, and
all valves are briefly closed.

00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:25.164
Pressure rises while ventricular volume is unchanged.

00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:29.300
When ventricular pressure exceeds
outflow pressure, the semilunar valves

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:29.555
open.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.167
The ventricles eject blood
toward the pulmonary artery and

00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:33.624
aorta.

00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:37.360
The animation tracks movement
rather than claiming a measured

00:00:37.360 --> 00:00:38.072
flow speed.

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:41.902
Semilunar valves close
during isovolumetric relaxation.

00:00:42.620 --> 00:00:45.676
All valves are again
closed until ventricular pressure falls

00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:48.620
enough for atrioventricular
opening and renewed filling.

00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:52.999
Chapter thirty one, slides
fifteen, sixteen and twenty through

00:00:52.999 --> 00:00:55.170
twenty three, support this sequence.

00:00:55.940 --> 00:01:00.173
Numeric chamber pressures and
complete abnormal tracing interpretation are

00:01:00.260 --> 00:01:00.977
not supplied.
